The '''Mercedes-Benz M117''' is an [[Overhead camshaft|OHC]] (overhead cam), 2 [[valve]] per [[cylinder (engine)|cylinder]] [[V8 engine]] made in several versions by [[Daimler-Benz]] between 1971 and 1992.

